KONOHAGAKURE BINGO BOOK — S-RANK THREAT PROFILE

Name: Orochimaru
Alias: "The White Snake Sannin"
Village of Origin: Konohagakure (defected)
Status: Missing-nin / Founder, Hidden Sound Village
Threat Level: S-Rank
Bounty: Capture priority — no ceiling authorized

Background: One of the legendary Sannin, student of the Third Hokage. Defected after his forbidden human experimentation was discovered. Founded Otogakure. Orchestrated the Konoha Crush and personally struck down the Third Hokage.

Known Abilities:
- Living Corpse Reincarnation: body-transfer technique granting effective longevity.
- Summoning: giant snakes, including Manda.
- Cursed Seal application; Impure World Reincarnation (Edo Tensei).
- Snake-based ninjutsu; extreme regeneration.

Engagement Notes: Extremely dangerous, deceptive, and patient. Known to target those with kekkei genkai and the Sharingan. Do not pursue below Jonin strength. Suspected long-term interest in Sasuke Uchiha.
